Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.06,0:00:00.67,Caption,,0,0,0,,What stops a
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.68,0:00:01.45,Caption,,0,0,0,,giant ship from
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.46,0:00:02.03,Caption,,0,0,0,,knocking down
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.04,0:00:02.55,Caption,,0,0,0,,a bridge?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.87,0:00:03.52,Caption,,0,0,0,,A pier can't
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.54,0:00:04.12,Caption,,0,0,0,,take that hit,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.56,0:00:05.37,Caption,,0,0,0,,so engineers put
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.38,0:00:06.17,Caption,,0,0,0,,guards around it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.49,0:00:07.38,Caption,,0,0,0,,These round islands
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.39,0:00:08.42,Caption,,0,0,0,,are called dolphins.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.74,0:00:09.19,Caption,,0,0,0,,Each is a
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.20,0:00:10.21,Caption,,0,0,0,,steel ring packed
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.22,0:00:10.56,Caption,,0,0,0,,with up to
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.57,0:00:11.68,Caption,,0,0,0,,six thousand seven
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.69,0:00:12.42,Caption,,0,0,0,,hundred tons of
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.44,0:00:13.13,Caption,,0,0,0,,crushed rock.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.45,0:00:14.01,Caption,,0,0,0,,When a ship
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.02,0:00:14.94,Caption,,0,0,0,,hits, the ring
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.95,0:00:15.63,Caption,,0,0,0,,bends and the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.64,0:00:16.69,Caption,,0,0,0,,rock packs tighter.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.01,0:00:17.69,Caption,,0,0,0,,The ship's bow
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.70,0:00:19.12,Caption,,0,0,0,,crumples too, soaking
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.13,0:00:19.80,Caption,,0,0,0,,up its energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.12,0:00:20.70,Caption,,0,0,0,,So the ship
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.72,0:00:21.54,Caption,,0,0,0,,stops before it
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.58,0:00:22.12,Caption,,0,0,0,,ever touches
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.13,0:00:22.60,Caption,,0,0,0,,the pier.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.92,0:00:23.50,Caption,,0,0,0,,Each one can
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.51,0:00:24.47,Caption,,0,0,0,,take nearly thirty
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.48,0:00:25.23,Caption,,0,0,0,,million pounds
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.24,0:00:25.84,Caption,,0,0,0,,of force.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.16,0:00:27.05,Caption,,0,0,0,,Florida built them
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.16,0:00:27.84,Caption,,0,0,0,,after a ship
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.85,0:00:28.48,Caption,,0,0,0,,knocked down its
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.50,0:00:29.85,Caption,,0,0,0,,Sunshine Skyway bridge
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.86,0:00:30.83,Caption,,0,0,0,,in nineteen eighty.
